## Interface: 20506
## Category: Commander
## Title: Commander Dossier
## Author: Devin
## Version: 2.1.0
## Notes: Intelligence on the enemy. A live diminishing-returns board — one row per player, one pip per category, each saying what your next crowd control will land at and when the window resets — plus a persistent file on every enemy you meet: class, guild, the spells you have watched them use, the specialisation that implies, and your record against them.
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Spyglass_02
## SavedVariables: CommanderDossierDB, CommanderDossierFile
## RequiredDeps: Commander_Events
## OptionalDeps: Commander_Talents

